## Verification Steps

### verifying History
1. Run an analysis in the "Analysis" tab.
2. Go to the "History" tab.
3. Verify that the new analysis appears in the list (click "Scan Archives" if needed).

### Verifying Advanced Params
1. Go to "Analysis" tab.
2. Toggle "Advanced Config" options (e.g., turn off "Blur").
3. Run analysis.
4. Check the logs (in Terminal View) or the result to ensure the pipeline respected the settings (e.g., faster processing or different visual output).

### Verifying Color Checker Upload
1. In the **Color Calibration** section, locate "Custom Color Checker".
2. Upload a custom reference image (file input).
3. Ensure "Enable Calibration" is checked.
4. Run Analysis and verify the pipeline uses the uploaded checker (logs will indicate this or result will differ).

